    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sibaneeda goowoowsa Yehoshafati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiigu Yehoshafati was sugoocheanda Yuda gheanyi mida Yerusalemu aba hoyyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yehu was orjeeda Hanani was meang'nyeanda gawa gwaroonyi niny, ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i gajamuusa weada fuga munyas nea gibwariinyi fuga sit NG'UTAMIIDA? Abeeda aba ng'asheanji, nyarasta leabu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA gaygoobisa badaydaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa gwanda gea miyaasiin sideaksa headaang'u, aba gideaba ninyarjeawayi Asherajeega aba badayda ng'eanyiida, nea ea niidoabiiw gurooroadaang'u aba gasiischooda ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidasin Yehoshafati",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobiida Yehoshafati Yerusalemu; ama ng'ata gwarita gawa bugusta buuneeda, gidang'eada Beer-sheba ea gagul ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Efraimu, aba ng'ata goodeelu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwaloat fuga laja girgweaguutka aba jeeda mujiinajeega sineaweesa hilooga bea Yuda, aba jeemba gilinyoo ea mujiini gil, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ama ng'ata gwayeesha fuga laja girgweaguutka, “Ang'ula muuchi gadiyeedeang'wa, aba gideaba moomiineadaysiini girgweaguutka buuneeda goomiineadaysi girgweageeda NG'UTAMIIDA; niny gwanda bugusteang'wa iissa iyoalaji girgweaguutka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa, danung' goobiida heedeanya gheawalmeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea goofurji muuchi gidoosinyi, aba gideaba aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANYA manda ng'asheanda muy, nea maduupa saseenuuka buuneeda, nea ea moang'oonya seawshooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba gicha aba Yerusalemu ea nighwal Yehoshafati fiisu ng'ay was fuga Lawi ea ashoohoodiga ea ghweaniga gealga fuga Israeli, ghoah fuga jea gwalaja girgweaguutka NG'UTAMIIDA nea gamiineadayiisa gilinyoo ea girgweaga gil. Ak hean geanung' goobiitpiit aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Nih gichea asinda gil aba gheawalmeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea aba doobiiwnata, ea aba gurooruunatkeagwa sean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinyo ghwaan heedeang'wa girgweageeda leabu heeda fuga ooduupcheewi abiita jeeda mujiinajeega nyaawa, was fuga niihiida foojeanda, ghana ea nidatas diigheanda ghana deaweeda, naweadinga ghana girgweaguutka, abeeda gajoorgweaksiina, adiidu gwasin munyinda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea moobisiina nyarastaanyi badahuukeagwa ea gea fuga ooduupcheewi. Nih gichea asina gil, ak abeeda ea maygwarina heedeang'wa ramaseanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa goong'ulayi, Amariya was ashoohoocheanda haw ghwanaawaneegwa aba ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA; ea Sebadiya was orjeeda Ishameli, was siida miineadaysa gheeda fuga Yuda, bea haleanjeeda sea bea sugoocheanda; nea fuga Lawi gaygadiyeeseegwa. Asina nea adiidu ghoabealji, nea NG'UTAMIIDA gagasa gwandeawa fuga doobiiweadi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
